      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for OCR text extraction. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice as it provides a robust service for extracting text from scanned documents. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to call the appropriate API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
